{"payload":{"control_surface":"programmatic_load_dispatch_receipt","counts":{"arbitration":0,"correction":0,"execution":1,"judgment":1,"organize":0,"total":2},"evidence_kind":"live_model","host_transport":"current_agent","method_request_seconds":39.08996108302381,"mode":"route-control.v0.2.1","native_plugin_activation":"not_claimed","original_input":{"authority":{"known_obligations":[],"mode":"read_only","owner_ref":"current-codex:formal-abc-v1","risk":"low"},"dependencies":[],"documents":[{"id":"U","kind":"user","revision":"1","text":"栖桥艺术中心想长期建设四个场馆共用的活动信息系统，但眼前必须完成秋季艺术节的信息发布。请提出本期应承诺的交付范围，以及在什么可观察条件下改用、暂停或扩大共用系统方案。"},{"id":"S","kind":"source","revision":"1","text":"四个场馆全年合计约 450 场活动，目前各自录入日历，每周合计约花 12 小时核对重复信息。秋季艺术节有 24 场活动，须在 2026 年 10 月 20 日上线，11 月 3 日结束。现有网站加共享表格能发布全部 24 场活动，但临时改期需要工作人员分别修改两个地方。共用系统的最小可用版本估计需 7 人周；上线前技术团队最多能投入 3 人周，活动结束后这两人还要转入已排定项目。明年四场馆是否继续由同一团队运营、以及相应预算是否获批，目前未知。"}],"episode_id":"formal-abc-v1-HC-B","issues":[{"assessability":null,"attention":true,"candidates":["sela","mpg"],"handling":{"owner_ref":"current-codex:formal-abc-v1","refs":[{"document_id":"U","end":83,"revision":"1","sha256":"f78153ea4bdb0a5d1630d24fd28d19f87511c02846989067f1ec518b8e6044ed","start":0}],"revision":"1","value":"judge"},"id":"I1","request_ref":{"document_id":"U","end":83,"revision":"1","sha256":"f78153ea4bdb0a5d1630d24fd28d19f87511c02846989067f1ec518b8e6044ed","start":0}}],"relationship":null,"revision":"1","schema":"mindthus.route-control-input.v1","task_budget":{"max_calls":1,"max_seconds":45},"turn_id":"1"},"outputs":{"I1":{"accepted_uses":{},"artifact_sha256":"d2d1fedb3921a61b1e926ee0ba24ea5a569c3ba26d07b1f0b36fb4c6477a7ef9","methods":["mpg","sela"],"revision":1,"route_id":"f823f04899d576b549be89f59c749b3ef31a1be95b302f4c3b2e91b7dff36691","text":"四馆共用系统有长期价值，但本期应先用现有网站和共享表格发布艺术节信息，暂停承诺共用系统上线。[U][S]\n\n本期承诺：在 2026 年 10 月 20 日前发布全部 24 场活动，并维护至 11 月 3 日艺术节结束。指定共享表格为核对依据；每次改期由明确的负责人同步修改表格和网站，再核对两处的时间、地点及活动状态。上线前逐场核对 24 场，活动期间记录改期与遗漏。上述流程是建议的交付安排，负责人和核对频率仍需落实。[S]\n\n判断依据：现有方式已能发布全部活动；共用系统最小版本估计要 7 人周，上线前只有 3 人周。四馆目前每周约花 12 小时核对重复信息，说明长期整合有潜在收益，但明年的运营团队和预算尚未确定，不能据此承诺本期完成系统。[S]\n\n调整条件：若上线前逐场核对发现现有方式无法按期完整发布，或改期后两处信息持续不一致，应立即改用经过实际验证、能承载全部 24 场及改期流程的发布方案；替代方案未经验证时，先修正人工同步流程。艺术节后若运营归属、预算或维护责任仍未确定，继续暂停共用系统开发。只有在这些责任明确、至少 7 人周的实施能力获安排，并用实际改期和跨馆录入流程验证可用后，才分阶段扩大共用系统；若重复核对耗时没有明显下降，则重新评估方案。[S]\n\n来源：[U] 用户提出的交付与调整条件；[S] 提供的活动量、工时、日期、现有能力和资源约束。"}},"pending":{},"pending_host_requests":[],"plugin_request_seconds":29.525379332946613,"qualification":false,"reason":null,"relationship":null,"reserved_counts":{"arbitration":0,"correction":0,"execution":0,"judgment":0,"organize":0,"total":0},"route":{"artifact_edges":[],"claim_ceiling":"routing instruction, not evidence, permission or semantic task acceptance","condition_sources":{"I1":{"assessability":null,"handling":{"owner_ref":"current-codex:formal-abc-v1","refs":[{"document_id":"U","end":83,"revision":"1","sha256":"f78153ea4bdb0a5d1630d24fd28d19f87511c02846989067f1ec518b8e6044ed","start":0}],"revision":"1","value":"judge"}}},"contract_hashes":{"docs/internal/research/typed-decision/mainline-composition-v0.1/method-bindings.json":"ce43c43f92e423717b49d47e1e907f7a9be61851cc0db520624cdb5981160b2e","docs/internal/research/typed-decision/mainline-composition-v0.1/questions.json":"8aa2e1c46f15dbdf184301f87dcbdfeb972b3b860300f0a7009d9c04b0c62717","docs/internal/research/typed-decision/route-control-v0.2/implementation-addendum.json":"f258cf196090108344e89cf9801404b7d80c2ace4a741e80b3c309ec6948077a","docs/internal/research/typed-decision/route-control-v0.2/profile.json":"cf57fbeececce81db2cef75290d0cc6f227ec1484625c8cdd5dc31d85c3d83e0","skills/3l5s/SKILL.md":"fe472b01eeaf724c047f6db486d0f860b82e5b47be2d4f1b5ebf3376e839cbb1","skills/edsp/SKILL.md":"4de72a21f227b77711cb8f48212e8f3cb42d5b3b0cd1b911ca3284aad40e240c","skills/mpg/SKILL.md":"1a8e4e5f7a382e24a266befd3b9f58b329253a0ecf49e55b0e9f5690eccf6bc0","skills/sela/SKILL.md":"71b34d7ae2b6312c41ed904dba00cc9bea6615d6e73a537ac20e5cd29fb1b9ad","skills/s